flowchart TD
    Start([User Submits Query via Portal UI]) --> AuthCheck{JWT Valid & Verified?}
    AuthCheck -- No --> Ret401[Return HTTP 401 Unauthorized]
    AuthCheck -- Yes --> Sanitize[Sanitize & Strip Prompt Injections]
    Sanitize --> ExtractRole[Extract User Identity & Role: Student, Faculty, Admin]
    ExtractRole --> RouteQuery{Query Intent Classification}
    
    RouteQuery -- Personal Academic/Attendance --> DirectDB[Query Normalized Relational Tables via StudentRepo]
    RouteQuery -- Graph Relationship --> GraphAgent[Execute Recursive CTE on okf_nodes & okf_edges]
    RouteQuery -- Institutional Policy --> VectorSearch[Query ChromaDB with Role-Audience Filter]
    
    DirectDB --> ExecEngines[Execute AttendanceRiskEngine & RecommendationEngine]
    GraphAgent --> FormatGraph[Format Graph Entities & Context]
    VectorSearch --> LexicalMatch[Compute TF-IDF Term Density Score]
    
    LexicalMatch --> HybridRerank[Deterministic Hybrid Rerank: 0.6 Vector + 0.4 Lexical]
    HybridRerank --> EvalQuality{Evidence Quality Assessment}
    
    EvalQuality -- Insufficient (Score < 0.25) --> RefusalAns[Return Grounded Fallback: No Institutional Match]
    EvalQuality -- High / Medium / Low --> PromptWrap[Wrap into Passive XML: untrusted_data Boundaries]
    
    FormatGraph --> PromptWrap
    ExecEngines --> AssembleResponse[Assemble Deterministic Structured Analytics]
    PromptWrap --> CallGemini[Invoke Google Gemini API with Strict System Rules]
    CallGemini --> AttachCitations[Attach First-Class Source Citations: Doc, Section, Score]
    
    RefusalAns --> AuditLog[Write Audit Event to Database via AuditRepository]
    AssembleResponse --> AuditLog
    AttachCitations --> AuditLog
    
    AuditLog --> ReturnResult([Return JSON Response to Frontend with Correlation ID])
